 we covered every major Splat except Demon. I could definitely see some saboteurs going after specific ships that they believe are parts of the good old Infrastructure, using the cover of pirate raids to make what they do seem mundane.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but the damn sands keeps getting in my demon's gears and the salt water plays hell with the electronics. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T15:37:48-07:00","id":1339940,"title":"","content":"I can't help but think my next game will be Renegades with East India Company Progenitors. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, so <i>that's </i>what the curse on Aztec gold was! Nigel, I think I have an idea!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}